    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/e10749be0ffe9313eb83f756f4003bd5.poster.avif?t=1748961074\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/e10749be0ffe9313eb83f756f4003bd5.webm?t=1748961074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/e10749be0ffe9313eb83f756f4003bd5.mp4?t=1748961074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths of the folder dungeon by traveling through various <strong>ZONES</strong>, but keep your eyes peeled because undiscovered\u00a0<strong>SECRET </strong>might be just around the corner! Be careful, because every action generates <strong>HEAT, </strong>so\u00a0don\u2019t stay in each zone for too long and defeat <strong>ZONE BOSS\u00a0</strong>before you <strong>OVERHEAT</strong>!    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/ec88f56c79deec34d0ee65261d27f540.poster.avif?t=1748961074\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/ec88f56c79deec34d0ee65261d27f540.webm?t=1748961074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/ec88f56c79deec34d0ee65261d27f540.mp4?t=1748961074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>TONS</strong> of different <strong>ITEMS</strong> to shape your run! Combine their effects to achieve <strong>GAME BREAKING COMBOS</strong> to overcome most difficult dungeon challenges. Not enough? Enhance items with <strong>MODS</strong> to truly make something <strong><i>unhinged</i></strong>!! Or find <strong>SPECIAL ITEMS</strong> from various\u00a0<strong>EVENTS</strong> that will let you reach even higher levels of absurdity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/61112bec49bc05fb8dde77bbcd8d3510.poster.avif?t=1748961074\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/61112bec49bc05fb8dde77bbcd8d3510.webm?t=1748961074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/61112bec49bc05fb8dde77bbcd8d3510.mp4?t=1748961074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every element is part of <strong>FOLDER</strong>\u00a0<strong>OS</strong>! Fight inside computer folder, use computer programs to your advantage, organize all windows as you wish or play little minigame in a middle of a run! Why not! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/cb8f9736560798a6becfc4ed2fe25048.avif?t=1748961074\" data-has-big width=800 height=778 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/3c48e990c073e5efc484a47148588ced.avif?t=1748961074\" data-has-big width=800 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To games that inspired Folder Dungeon:</strong> <br>Ring of Pain <br>Kingsway <br>Monster Train <br> <br><strong>To people that are helping Folder Dungeon to be the best it can:</strong>   <br>Graeme (2 Left Thumbs)  <br>Esty (The Game Doctor) <br>And all Playtesters!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/e10749be0ffe9313eb83f756f4003bd5.poster.avif?t=1748961074\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/e10749be0ffe9313eb83f756f4003bd5.webm?t=1748961074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/e10749be0ffe9313eb83f756f4003bd5.mp4?t=1748961074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths of the folder dungeon by traveling through various <strong>ZONES</strong>, but keep your eyes peeled because undiscovered\u00a0<strong>SECRET </strong>might be just around the corner! Be careful, because every action generates <strong>HEAT, </strong>so\u00a0don\u2019t stay in each zone for too long and defeat <strong>ZONE BOSS\u00a0</strong>before you <strong>OVERHEAT</strong>!    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/ec88f56c79deec34d0ee65261d27f540.poster.avif?t=1748961074\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/ec88f56c79deec34d0ee65261d27f540.webm?t=1748961074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/ec88f56c79deec34d0ee65261d27f540.mp4?t=1748961074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>TONS</strong> of different <strong>ITEMS</strong> to shape your run! Combine their effects to achieve <strong>GAME BREAKING COMBOS</strong> to overcome most difficult dungeon challenges. Not enough? Enhance items with <strong>MODS</strong> to truly make something <strong><i>unhinged</i></strong>!! Or find <strong>SPECIAL ITEMS</strong> from various\u00a0<strong>EVENTS</strong> that will let you reach even higher levels of absurdity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/61112bec49bc05fb8dde77bbcd8d3510.poster.avif?t=1748961074\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/61112bec49bc05fb8dde77bbcd8d3510.webm?t=1748961074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/61112bec49bc05fb8dde77bbcd8d3510.mp4?t=1748961074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every element is part of <strong>FOLDER</strong>\u00a0<strong>OS</strong>! Fight inside computer folder, use computer programs to your advantage, organize all windows as you wish or play little minigame in a middle of a run! Why not! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/cb8f9736560798a6becfc4ed2fe25048.avif?t=1748961074\" data-has-big width=800 height=778 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853830/extras/3c48e990c073e5efc484a47148588ced.avif?t=1748961074\" data-has-big width=800 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To games that inspired Folder Dungeon:</strong> <br>Ring of Pain <br>Kingsway <br>Monster Train <br> <br><strong>To people that are helping Folder Dungeon to be the best it can:</strong>   <br>Graeme (2 Left Thumbs)  <br>Esty (The Game Doctor) <br>And all Playtesters!</p>",
